{"id": "21-945-2-4", "zh": "281.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-946-2-10", "zh": "“血”称为 rudhira、soṇita、ratta；“唾液”称为 lālā、kheḷa、elā；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-947-2-9", "zh": "“胆汁”称为 māyu（阳性）与 pitta；“痰”称为 semha（非阴性）与 silesuma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-948-2-4", "zh": "282.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-949-2-10", "zh": "溶化的油脂称为 vasā；“脂肪”称为 meda 与 vapā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-950-2-9", "zh": "“装束”称为 ākappa、vesa、nepaccha；“装饰”称为 maṇḍana、pasādhana、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-951-2-4", "zh": "283.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-952-2-7", "zh": "vibhūsana、ābharaṇa、alaṅkāra、pilandhana；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-953-2-9", "zh": "“王冠”称为 kirīṭa、makuṭa（非阴性）；“顶髻宝珠”称为 cūḷāmaṇi、siromaṇi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-954-2-4", "zh": "284.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-955-2-8", "zh": "“头巾”称为 siroveṭhana、uṇhīsa；“耳环”称为 kuṇḍala、kaṇṇaveṭhana；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-956-2-8", "zh": "kaṇṇikā 与 kaṇṇapūra 都是耳饰（kaṇṇavibhūsana）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-957-2-4", "zh": "285.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-958-2-10", "zh": "“颈饰”称为 kaṇṭhabhūsā、gīveyya；“珠串项链”称为 hāra 与 muttāvali（阴性）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-959-2-8", "zh": "“手镯”称为 niyura、valaya（非阴性）、kaṭaka、parihāraka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-960-2-4", "zh": "286.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-961-2-17", "zh": "kaṅkaṇa 是手上的饰物；“小铃”称为 kiṅkiṇī（某本作 kiṃkaṇī、kiṃkaṇikā）与 khuddaghaṇṭikā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-962-2-10", "zh": "“戒指”称为 aṅgulīyaka、aṅgulyābharaṇa；刻有文字的戒指", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-963-2-4", "zh": "287.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-964-2-10", "zh": "称为 muddikā、aṅgulimuddā；“腰带”称为 rasanā、mekhalā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-965-2-6", "zh": "keyūra 与 aṅgada 是上臂的饰物。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-966-2-4", "zh": "288.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-967-2-8", "zh": "“脚镯”称为 pādaṅgada、mañjīra、pādakaṭaka、nūpura；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-968-2-4", "zh": "289.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-969-2-9", "zh": "饰物的种类，有 mukhaphulla、uṇṇata、", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-970-2-7", "zh": "uggatthana、giṅgamaka 等等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-971-2-4", "zh": "290.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-972-2-9", "zh": "“衣服”称为 cela、acchādana、vattha、vāsa、vasana、aṃsuka、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-973-2-10", "zh": "ambara、paṭa（非阴性）、dussa、cola 与 sāṭaka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-974-2-4", "zh": "291.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-975-2-10", "zh": "khoma（亚麻布）、dukūla（细布）、koseyya（丝绸）、pattuṇṇa（绢布）、kambala（毛织品）、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-976-2-9", "zh": "sāṇa（麻布）、koṭumbara、bhaṅga 等，被认为是各种不同的布料。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-977-2-4", "zh": "292.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-978-2-6", "zh": "“下衣”称为 nivāsana、antarīya、antara、antaravāsaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-979-2-9", "zh": "“上衣”称为 pāvāra、uttarāsaṅga、upasaṃbyāna、uttara、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-980-2-4", "zh": "293.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-981-2-10", "zh": "uttarīya；新衣被认为称作 ahata；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-982-2-9", "zh": "nantaka、kappaṭa、paṭaccara 是“旧衣”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-983-2-4", "zh": "294.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-984-2-9", "zh": "“甲衣”称为 kañcuka 或 vāravāṇa；布料的边缘部分称为 dasā；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-985-2-8", "zh": "戴在头上的 kañcuka 叫作 **nālipaṭṭa**。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-986-2-4", "zh": "295.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-987-2-5", "zh": "“长度”称为 āyāma、dīghatā、roha，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-988-2-4", "zh": "“宽度”称为 pariṇāha、visālatā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-989-2-4", "zh": "296.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-990-2-9", "zh": "“袈裟”称为 arahaddhaja（阿罗汉之幢）、kāsāya、kāsāva 与 cīvara；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-991-2-9", "zh": "它的各个部分称为 maṇḍala、vivaṭṭa、kusi 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-992-2-4", "zh": "297.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-993-2-13", "zh": "果实、树皮、虫、毛，这些是布料的来源；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-994-2-10", "zh": "phāla 即 kappāsika（棉布），三性通用；khoma 等则出自树皮。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-995-2-4", "zh": "298.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-996-2-12", "zh": "koseyya 由虫而生；毛制的称为 kambala；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-997-2-8", "zh": "“帷幕”称为 javanikā，与它同义的是 tirokaraṇī。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-998-2-4", "zh": "299.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-999-2-8", "zh": "“天篷”称为 ulloca（阳性或中性）与 vitāna，两者同义；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1000-2-10", "zh": "“沐浴”称为 nahāna 与 sināna；“擦身”称为 ubbaṭṭana 与 ummajjana，两者同义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1001-2-4", "zh": "300.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1002-2-10", "zh": "“额上的饰点”称为 visesaka、tilaka（两者非阴性）与 cittaka；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1003-2-9", "zh": "“檀香”称为 candana（非阴性）、gandhasāra、malayaja。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1004-2-4", "zh": "301.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1005-2-8", "zh": "“黄檀香”称为 gosīsa、telapaṇṇika，以及 haricandana（也可作阳性）；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1006-2-8", "zh": "“红檀香”称为 tilapaṇṇī、pattaṅga、rañjana、rattacandana。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1007-2-4", "zh": "302.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1008-2-12", "zh": "“黑檀香”称为 kāḷānusārī、kāḷiya；“沉香”称为 loha、agaru、agaḷu；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1009-2-11", "zh": "其中黑色的称为 kāḷāgaru；“乳香”称为 turukkha 与 piṇḍaka。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1010-2-4", "zh": "303.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1011-2-8", "zh": "“麝香”称为 katthūrikā、migamada；“木香”称为 kuṭṭha、ajapālaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1012-2-8", "zh": "“丁香”称为 lavaṅga、devakusuma；“番红花”称为 kasmīraja、kuṅkuma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1013-2-4", "zh": "304.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1014-2-9", "zh": "“娑罗树脂”称为 yakkhadhūpa、sajjulasa；“荜澄茄”称为 takkola、kolaka、", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1015-2-9", "zh": "kosaphala；“肉豆蔻”称为 jātikosa 与 jātiphala。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1016-2-4", "zh": "305.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1017-2-8", "zh": "“樟脑”称为 ghanasāra、sitabbha，以及 kappūra（阳性或中性）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1018-2-9", "zh": "“紫胶红染料”称为 alattaka、yāvaka；“紫胶”称为 lākhā 与 jatu（中性）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1019-2-4", "zh": "306.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1020-2-11", "zh": "“松脂”称为 sirivāsa、saraladdava；“眼膏”称为 añjana、kajjala；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1021-2-8", "zh": "“香粉”称为 vāsacuṇṇa、vāsayoga；“涂香”称为 vaṇṇaka、vilepana。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1022-2-4", "zh": "307.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1023-2-8", "zh": "用香料、花鬘等来熏制加工，这称为 vāsana；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1024-2-17", "zh": "“花鬘”称为 mālā、mālya、pupphadāma（某本作 puppha、dāma）；“熏过的”称为 bhāvita、vāsita，三性通用。", "confidence": 65}
